      "node_id": "kg_doc_1",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Případy 1. oddělení (\"Cases of the 1st Department\" in English) is a Czech crime television series. The series is based on real criminal cases investigated by Czech Police. People involved in screenwrighting of the series include Jan Malinda (journalist MF Dnes) a Josef Mareš (chief investigator oat the real 1st department). The series was selected the best Czech crime television series in last decade. Main characters are based on real life investigators and other people. The cases reflect some of the most famous real criminal cases of the modern Czech Republic.",
